&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT FANDUEL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FanDuel Group is the premier mobile gaming company in the United States and Canada. FanDuel Group consists of a portfolio of leading brands across mobile wagering including: America’s #1 Sportsbook, FanDuel Sportsbook; its leading iGaming platform, FanDuel Casino; the industry’s unquestioned leader in horse racing and advance-deposit wagering, FanDuel Racing; and its daily fantasy sports product. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, FanDuel Group operates FanDuel TV, its broadly distributed linear cable television network and FanDuel TV+, its leading direct-to-consumer OTT platform. FanDuel Group has a presence across all 50 states, Canada, and Puerto Rico.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The company is based in New York with US offices in Los Angeles, Atlanta, and Jersey City, as well as global offices in Canada and Scotland. The company’s affiliates have offices worldwide, including in Ireland, Portugal, Romania, and Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FanDuel Group is a subsidiary of Flutter Entertainment, the world&#39;s largest sports betting and gaming operator with a portfolio of globally recognized brands and traded on the New York Stock Exchange (NYSE: FLUT).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;FanDuel is an equal opportunities employer. Diversity and inclusion in FanDuel means that we respect and value everyone as individuals. We don&#39;t tolerate bias, judgement or harassment. Our focus is on developing employees so that they reach their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;FanDuel is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities. If you have a disability and need a workplace accommodation or adjustment during the application and hiring process, including support for the interview or onboarding process, please email&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;ms-outlook-linkify&quot; ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The requirements listed in our job descriptions are guidelines, not hard and fast rules. You don’t have to satisfy every requirement or meet every qualification listed. If your skills are transferable and you are in the ballpark experience-wise, we&#39;d love to speak to you!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Software Engineering  Edinburgh

Electronics Engineer &lt;p&gt;As an Electronics Engineer, you will be a member of our interdisciplinary hardware engineering team, contributing to the design and development of electronics for our next-generation drone platforms. You’ll work on electronic modules such as flight controllers, sensors, and vision systems, supporting PCB development from concept through production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of a cross-functional team, you will contribute to advanced systems such as interceptor and reconnaissance drones with integrated visual navigation, as well as quadcopters for defense applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, prototype, and validate avionics PCBs, sensors, and electronic modules for drone platforms, contributing to designs from initial concepts through detailed design and manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support PCB and product verification activities, including test planning, execution, and documentation; contribute to electrical and mechanical validation such as EMI/EMC compliance testing, thermal cycling, and mechanical shock testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain technical documentation, including design concepts, schematics and CAD drawings, bills of materials (BOMs), assembly instructions, and repair documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with test engineering, manufacturing, and production teams to support the transition of hardware designs from development to production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with hardware and software engineers to define electronics requirements, system interfaces, and design solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support troubleshooting and design improvements based on test results, production feedback, and field performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development and improvement of engineering processes and best practices within the hardware team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Electrical or Electronics Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in PCB design and electronic product development, including prototyping, layout, and testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of mixed-signal PCB design, signal integrity, and power integrity principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with PCB testing and troubleshooting, including basic EMC considerations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Altium Designer is highly desirable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with high-power applications, ESCs, and lithium batteries is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, solution-oriented mindset with a proactive approach to problem-solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively as part of a cross-functional hardware/software team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good problem-solving and communication skills, with a willingness to learn and take ownership of assigned tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CH/EU citizenship required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Car parking&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Engineering  Zurich

Data API Engineer &lt;p&gt;FanDuel Group is a world-class team of brands and products that deliver sports betting, gaming and entertainment to millions of US sports fans every day. That’s no easy task and wouldn&#39;t be possible without a fantastic team who have helped us pioneer new products and innovative features that make us a leader in the industry.&lt;br&gt;The company is based in New York with US offices in Los Angeles, Atlanta, and Jersey City, as well as global offices&amp;nbsp;in Canada and Scotland. The company’s affiliates have offices worldwide, including in Ireland, Portugal, Romania,&amp;nbsp;and Australia.&lt;br&gt;FanDuel Group is a subsidiary of Flutter Entertainment, the world&#39;s largest sports betting and gaming operator&amp;nbsp;with a portfolio of globally recognized brands and traded on the New York Stock Exchange (NYSE: FLUT).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE POSITION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our roster has an opening with your name on it&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for a Data API Engineer (Software Engineer with interest in Data applications) to join our&amp;nbsp;growing team and help build the Applications with REST API endpoints to provide recommendations based on&amp;nbsp;data pipelines, ML Model and infrastructure that power analytics, machine learning, and drive business and&amp;nbsp;customer insights across the company. In this role, you’ll contribute to the design, development, and&amp;nbsp;maintenance of reliable Fraud recommendation applications while collaborating with stakeholders to support&lt;br&gt;high-impact data use cases.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The ideal candidate is a strong technical contributor who enjoys working with building software and data&amp;nbsp;applications at scale, solving practical problems, and continuously learning in a fast-paced environment.&amp;nbsp;If you’re excited by this challenge and want to work within a dynamic company, then we’d love to hear from&amp;nbsp;you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE GAME PLAN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Everyone on our team has a part to play&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Build &amp;amp; Maintain Data Pipelines&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Design, build, and maintain scalable Python Flask API applications or similar programming languages to achieve low latency response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Understanding and experience in developing batch and stream data ingestion or developed applications leveraging SQL database like Postrgres DB or NoSQL/Redis DB.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implemented REST API endpoints on Kubernetes cluster using API Gateway like KONG.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ensure API response is reliable, accurate, and delivered in a timely manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, efficient, and well-documented code and test cases using tools like Python, SQL, and Pyspark (optional).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands containerization and Kubernetes deployment using ArgoCD.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Collaborate Across Teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Senior Engineers in code reviews, design discussions, planning sessions and team&amp;nbsp;ceremonies, asking questions and sharing ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with data analysts, data scientists, and product managers to understand requirements andn&amp;nbsp;deliver actionable data solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business questions into engineering tasks and contribute to technical planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code reviews, sprint planning, and retrospectives as part of an agile team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quality &amp;amp; Operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor applications and troubleshoot issues in a timely, systematic manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement data quality checks and contribute to observability and testing practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document data sources, transformations, and architecture decisions to support long-term maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PLAYER CONTRACT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We treat our team right&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;FanDuel is an equal opportunities employer, and we believe, as one of our principles states, “We are One&amp;nbsp;Team!”. As such, we are committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ethnicity,&amp;nbsp;ancestry, religion, creed, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship status, marital status,&amp;nbsp;disability, gender identity, gender expression, veteran status, or another other characteristic protected by&amp;nbsp;state, local or federal law. We believe FanDuel is strongest and best able to compete if all employees feel&lt;br&gt;valued, respected, and included.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Data Engineering  Edinburgh

Staff Digital Product Designer – E-Commerce / Web Platform &lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Staff Digital Product Designer – E-Commerce / Web Platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt; E-Commerce &amp;amp; Customer Experience / Web Team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level:&lt;/strong&gt; Individual Contributor Lead (Staff Level)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Lille / Paris&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Context &amp;amp; Project&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon&#39;s purpose is to bring people together through sport to make wellbeing accessible for all, guiding our overarching ambition to build a &lt;strong&gt;Local Human Bond&lt;/strong&gt; and deliver accessible, unique sporting solutions globally. In this context, our goal is to build personalized, enriched experiences across all digital touchpoints and physical stores, leveraging Digital, Data, and AI to elevate the global customer journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The E-Commerce Web Challenge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the digital front door for millions of sport practice enthusiasts around the globe, our web platform (decathlon.country) must seamlessly convert online curiosity into real-world sport experiences. Our challenge is to transform a massive, multi-category web store into an intuitive, frictionless digital portal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We need to guide every user—from a first-time visitor searching for sports goods to a returning member—through a smooth journey that connects online browsing directly with local store availability, click-and-collect, and circular services like rentals and repairs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By building a standardized, modular web experience, we equip country teams and international franchise partners with pre-validated, high-converting funnel journeys so they can scale local commerce effortlessly without rebuilding core web experiences from scratch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scope &amp;amp; Structure (4 Dedicated E-Com Squads)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Acquisition:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn global internet users into active visitors through high-converting landing experiences, SEO, campaign entry points, and personalized traffic onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigation:&lt;/strong&gt; Help users find the exact product or advice they need within a vast catalog through intelligent search, taxonomy, filtering, and catalog hierarchy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Decision:&lt;/strong&gt; Give users every compelling reason to choose a product using rich product detail pages (PDP), media, sizing confidence, customer reviews, and circular/sustainability options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conversion:&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver frictionless checkout, flexible payment methods, order self-tracking, store pickup options, and effortless returns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Digital Product Designer&lt;/strong&gt;, you operate as a principal individual contributor and strategic leader within the Decathlon E-Commerce team. Operating with high autonomy on complex, cross-squad web challenges, you shape our long-term&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;E-Commerce Web Experience Vision&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work in close triad leadership with &lt;strong&gt;Staff Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Staff Product Managers (GPMs)&lt;/strong&gt;, while partnering hand-in-hand with a &lt;strong&gt;dedicated UX Researcher (UXR)&lt;/strong&gt; as your main practice partner to ground every design decision in deep user insights and quantitative data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond defining strategy, you lead &lt;strong&gt;hands-on experimentation, product de-risking, and rapid validation loops&lt;/strong&gt;—ensuring high-stakes web features across Acquisition, Navigation, Decision, and Conversion are proven through A/B testing, CRO analysis, and real user data before global rollout. You align the 4 web squads around a unified web vision, accelerate commercial value delivery, and elevate design craft maturity across teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Alignment &amp;amp; Web Funnel Vision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Triad Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Staff Engineers, Staff PMs, and your dedicated UXR partner to define long-term roadmaps, tech feasibility, and strategic UX priorities across squads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Web Experience Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and advocate for the long-term web design strategy, establishing web principles that influence product and commercial roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4-Squad Orchestration:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive alignment across the &lt;strong&gt;Acquisition, Navigation, Decision, and Conversion&lt;/strong&gt; squads to ensure a cohesive end-to-end web journey without siloed user friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Priority Segment Focus:&lt;/strong&gt; Set strategic web UX direction tailored to key user segments (&lt;strong&gt;Families, New Customers, Members&lt;/strong&gt;), driving personalization and context-aware landing journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Macro Metrics Tracking:&lt;/strong&gt; Track and optimize web performance metrics across the full funnel: &lt;strong&gt;SEO Traffic, CTR, Search Success, Add-to-Cart Rate, Conversion Rate, and Retention&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product De-Risking &amp;amp; Web Experimentation Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research Partner Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Work hand-in-hand with UXR to formulate hypotheses, map user knowledge gaps, and design research strategies for complex e-commerce flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;De-Risking Frameworks:&lt;/strong&gt; Formulate and drive product de-risking strategies for high-impact web initiatives—identifying usability, commercial, and technical risks early in discovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Concrete Web Experimentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and execute hands-on A/B tests, multivariate testing, CRO experiments, and prototype usability tests across the 4 squads to validate hypotheses before engineering rollouts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Informed Decisions:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Data &amp;amp; Analytics leads to build quantitative testing frameworks, leveraging web analytics to guide roadmap trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing Culture Elevation:&lt;/strong&gt; Coach web product squads on hypothesis formulation, CRO best practices, and rapid build-measure-learn loops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Role &amp;amp; Responsibilities (Skills &amp;amp; Behaviors)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Craft / Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research &amp;amp; Web Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with our UXR to enrich foundational customer knowledge (B2C web journeys) and co-define a CX vision to build collective alignment across stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem Discovery:&lt;/strong&gt; Uncover drop-off points across the 4 squads through quantitative funnel analytics and qualitative research; structure decisions using Opportunity Solution Trees (OST).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Discovery:&lt;/strong&gt; Explore and prototype web interfaces early and often; design high-converting, accessible, and responsive layouts connected to our Design System.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing &amp;amp; CRO:&lt;/strong&gt; Continuously de-risk solution feasibility, usability, and conversion lift using context-tailored testing tools (A/B testing, user testing, CRO analytics).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Exploration:&lt;/strong&gt; Test and integrate AI tools (e.g., generative search, smart recommendations, automated layout testing) to amplify design and research workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Behaviors / Soft Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Strategic Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead cross-squad web taskforces alongside Staff Engineering and Staff PMs, make sound decisions under partial data, and support the Design Manager in org planning and hiring committees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence &amp;amp; Emotional Intelligence:&lt;/strong&gt; Work proactively across PMs, Engineering Managers, and Business Leads to shape priorities using emotional intelligence and data-backed storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Involve engineering, data, UXR, and SEO teams early in the design process to create a psychologically safe, feedback-rich environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design Mentoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Elevate the web design practice by mentoring 3–4 designers, facilitating cross-squad design critiques, and connecting design solutions across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn failed A/B experiments into collective learning opportunities and maintain a structured personal growth plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. Why Join the E-Commerce Web Team?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenges You Will Tackle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Scale Web Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Optimizing a global web platform handling millions of daily visits across dozens of international markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4-Squad Synergy:&lt;/strong&gt; Unifying &lt;strong&gt;Acquisition, Navigation, Decision, and Conversion&lt;/strong&gt; into one fluid, frictionless web journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Triad Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Working in direct alignment with Staff Engineering, Staff PMs, and a dedicated UXR partner to shape high-level product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance &amp;amp; Accessibility at Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Designing lightweight, lightning-fast web pages that meet strict WCAG accessibility and SEO benchmarks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This Role Is a Perfect Match for You If…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive on &lt;strong&gt;de-risking web journeys via A/B testing and CRO data&lt;/strong&gt; rather than subjective opinions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You excel at &lt;strong&gt;triad collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; with Staff Tech and Staff PMs, backed by deep research partnership with UXR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy &lt;strong&gt;orchestrating design across multiple squads&lt;/strong&gt; (Acquisition through Conversion) to deliver a unified customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
